36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:36,030 --> 00:01:37,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going...</font>

39
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:39,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to become the Hokage.</font>

40
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't lose here!</font>

41
00:01:44,450 --> 00:01:46,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You? Hokage?!</font>

42
00:01:46,290 --> 00:01:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you're weaker than me?</font>

43
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll become... Hokage for you!</font>

44
00:01:58,300 --> 00:01:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

45
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey hey, are you serious?</font>

46
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been here three years</font>

47
00:02:06,730 --> 00:02:08,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you can't even do
a respectable transformation?!</font>

48
00:02:09,350 --> 00:02:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of you watch now!</font>

49
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will absolutely someday become
the true and real Hokage!</font>

50
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lame! What Hokage?!</font>

51
00:02:24,990 --> 00:02:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know deep down inside that
you can't become the Hokage.</font>

52
00:02:29,830 --> 00:02:31,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So quit acting tough!</font>

53
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:34,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong Kiba-kun...</font>

54
00:02:54,230 --> 00:02:57,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you compete with me for
the name of Hokage...</font>

55
00:02:59,650 --> 00:03:03,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... will be the loser!</font>

56
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:09,750
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Hinata</font>

57
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:09,750
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Blushes!</font>

58
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:09,750
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Crowd
Opens Their
Mouths Wide,</font>

59
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:09,750
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Naruto's
Trump
Card</font>

60
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:22,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man! Same thing over and over again.
You're pesky!</font>

61
00:03:27,220 --> 00:03:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, never mind.</font>

62
00:03:28,430 --> 00:03:32,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just make it so
you won't stand up again!</font>

63
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:33,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Akamaru!</font>

64
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think you can get me with
that same technique again?!</font>

65
00:03:39,070 --> 00:03:39,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

66
00:04:03,970 --> 00:04:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

67
00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:09,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over Fang!</font>

68
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu...</font>

69
00:04:16,770 --> 00:04:18,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though, I've seen it before...</font>

70
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:21,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's not a Jutsu you can dodge
over and over!</font>

71
00:04:22,150 --> 00:04:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do I do?</font>

72
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?!</font>

73
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:39,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like you've got nothing left.</font>

74
00:04:40,050 --> 00:04:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got plenty left!</font>

75
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:45,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you increased yourself by
three or four, I'd still have a lot left!</font>

76
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got a comeback
for everything!</font>

77
00:04:49,350 --> 00:04:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's finish him with the next!
Akamaru!</font>

78
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:11,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

79
00:05:12,250 --> 00:05:14,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to counterattack somehow.</font>

80
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:20,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I do, it has to get Kiba
or there's no point!</font>

81
00:05:21,170 --> 00:05:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But which is which...?</font>

82
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:30,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What will you do? Naruto!</font>

83
00:05:31,970 --> 00:05:32,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

84
00:05:38,190 --> 00:05:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That's it!</font>

85
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

86
00:05:48,110 --> 00:05:49,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mine!</font>

87
00:05:57,290 --> 00:05:58,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see how it is...</font>

88
00:05:59,460 --> 00:06:00,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

89
00:06:00,170 --> 00:06:01,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There, look closely.</font>

90
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

91
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it!</font>

92
00:06:18,190 --> 00:06:20,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a clever move, Naruto!</font>

93
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

94
00:06:23,650 --> 00:06:25,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he transforms into Kiba,</font>

95
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the real Kiba doesn't know which is
Akamaru and which is Naruto...</font>

96
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't attack carelessly.</font>

97
00:06:32,530 --> 00:06:37,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, it's okay for Naruto-kun
to attack either one!</font>

98
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

99
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He created a chance opening...</font>

100
00:06:41,710 --> 00:06:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work!</font>

101
00:06:42,790 --> 00:06:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, so that's your move...</font>

102
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:46,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

103
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you a piece of advice!</font>

104
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was careless before and
a little late to realize it...</font>

105
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the Transformation Jutsu
isn't effective anymore!</font>

106
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why, you ask?</font>

107
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:01,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

108
00:07:06,110 --> 00:07:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can smell you.</font>

109
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:13,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with our
sense of smell, Naruto.</font>

110
00:07:16,950 --> 00:07:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By concentrating his Chakra
into his nose,</font>

111
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:22,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba's sense of smell is enhanced tens
of thousands of times more than average.</font>

112
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, he can determine
people by their smell too.</font>

113
00:07:28,130 --> 00:07:29,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, I won!</font>

114
00:07:32,050 --> 00:07:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?!</font>

115
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:39,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?!</font>

116
00:07:39,850 --> 00:07:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba's nose got Naruto and
Akamaru mixed up?</font>

117
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:50,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! What in the world is going on...?!</font>

118
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:56,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you're Naruto!</font>

119
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Messing with me!</font>

120
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:03,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

121
00:08:10,550 --> 00:08:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, this is coming from
the original prankster, after all...</font>

122
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's had it!</font>

123
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He did it!</font>

124
00:08:31,490 --> 00:08:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun... Awesome!</font>

125
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

126
00:08:54,930 --> 00:08:55,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's it...</font>

127
00:08:56,890 --> 00:08:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, transformed into Kiba,</font>

128
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:01,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was discovered by the real Kiba
with smell and hit...</font>

129
00:09:04,190 --> 00:09:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Naruto didn't come back
in true Naruto form.</font>

130
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:08,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instead, he transformed into
Akamaru instantly!</font>

131
00:09:10,860 --> 00:09:13,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to make it look as if it
was Akamaru who was hit</font>

132
00:09:13,190 --> 00:09:16,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and his impersonation
transformation dissolved!</font>

133
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was Naruto ever that smart...?</font>

134
00:09:24,330 --> 00:09:25,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...!</font>

135
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think hard about your Jutsu
before you use them!</font>

136
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because they'll be used
against you, stupid!</font>

137
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:38,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's using my line, word to word...</font>

138
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:42,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arguing with this guy is only
a waste of time!</font>

139
00:09:43,020 --> 00:09:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't go at Naruto's pace...</font>

140
00:09:45,230 --> 00:09:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down.</font>

141
00:09:49,270 --> 00:09:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down!</font>

142
00:09:55,030 --> 00:09:58,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't actually keep up with
my movements yet...</font>

143
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I still have the advantage!</font>

144
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:06,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look closely at Naruto's movements
and if there's an opening...</font>

145
00:10:07,250 --> 00:10:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can surely take him from
behind with the All-Four Jutsu.</font>

146
00:10:11,250 --> 00:10:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing to get flustered about...</font>

147
00:10:13,750 --> 00:10:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I do this in a level-headed manner,
it's a match I will most certainly win!</font>

148
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evidently your enemy
has become calm...</font>

149
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:22,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, what will you do, Naruto...?</font>

150
00:10:26,890 --> 00:10:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you've finally gotten serious, Kiba?</font>

151
00:10:30,270 --> 00:10:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then... I'll end this...</font>

152
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with my new special technique
I've been saving up!</font>

153
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:43,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you've finally gotten serious, Kiba?</font>

154
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then... I'll end this...</font>

155
00:10:47,290 --> 00:10:51,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with my new special technique
I've been saving up!</font>

156
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

157
00:10:54,590 --> 00:10:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">New special trick?!</font>

158
00:10:56,590 --> 00:10:58,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? When did he...?!</font>

159
00:10:59,430 --> 00:11:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to Naruto-kun to hide
a new technique!</font>

160
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What new special technique!</font>

161
00:11:05,930 --> 00:11:07,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's obviously a bluff!</font>

162
00:11:07,770 --> 00:11:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can test out whether
it's a bluff or not!</font>

163
00:11:12,730 --> 00:11:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This hasn't changed since before...</font>

164
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:16,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't let his pace get to you.</font>

165
00:11:16,940 --> 00:11:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down!</font>

166
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

167
00:11:20,490 --> 00:11:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what kind of
technique this is but...!</font>

168
00:11:22,780 --> 00:11:24,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just won't let you do it!</font>

169
00:11:32,170 --> 00:11:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

170
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:35,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art of Beast Mimicry...
All-Four Jutsu!</font>

171
00:11:41,090 --> 00:11:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Q-Quick...</font>

172
00:11:46,010 --> 00:11:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you stopping?!</font>

173
00:11:51,690 --> 00:11:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

174
00:11:53,150 --> 00:11:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

175
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:06,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought, this is as
far as he will go.</font>

176
00:12:12,290 --> 00:12:13,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand up! Naruto!</font>

177
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn! I don't even have time
to work up my Chakra!</font>

178
00:12:21,590 --> 00:12:23,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey! What's wrong?!</font>

179
00:12:23,470 --> 00:12:24,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

180
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast!</font>

181
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:34,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good.</font>

182
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He doesn't have time to
form hand Signs!</font>

183
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's too much of a difference
in their strength...</font>

184
00:12:40,070 --> 00:12:41,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible for Naruto, after all.</font>

185
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

186
00:12:51,660 --> 00:12:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn!</font>

187
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

188
00:13:06,430 --> 00:13:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

189
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take that!</font>

190
00:13:24,070 --> 00:13:25,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to be Hokage!</font>

191
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:30,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose here!</font>

192
00:13:30,450 --> 00:13:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever! You can't keep up
with my speed at all!</font>

193
00:13:52,220 --> 00:13:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!</font>

194
00:13:58,900 --> 00:13:59,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

195
00:14:05,570 --> 00:14:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is what it's like when
I really let it out.</font>

196
00:14:18,170 --> 00:14:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand, don't you?</font>

197
00:14:19,670 --> 00:14:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me, you're merely...!</font>

198
00:14:55,740 --> 00:14:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

199
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

200
00:15:03,210 --> 00:15:04,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will absolutely not lose!</font>

201
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:10,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto... He's a fighter.</font>

202
00:15:10,630 --> 00:15:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup.</font>

203
00:15:12,090 --> 00:15:15,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I were Kiba,
I'd be sick of this already.</font>

204
00:15:16,970 --> 00:15:21,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter which anymore,
I just wish they'd settle it quickly.</font>

205
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

206
00:15:23,770 --> 00:15:24,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight!</font>

207
00:15:25,650 --> 00:15:28,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Use the new technique
or whatever!</font>

208
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just settle it!</font>

209
00:15:29,700 --> 00:15:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun! Go for it!</font>

210
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:43,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to find some opening
in that damn Kiba...</font>

211
00:15:45,790 --> 00:15:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got absolutely no effect on me!</font>

212
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:50,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got spirit, I'll give you that!</font>

213
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:53,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's close at his end...</font>

214
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll settle it with the next one!</font>

215
00:15:55,550 --> 00:15:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make the new technique
explode no matter what!</font>

216
00:15:59,770 --> 00:16:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you!</font>

217
00:16:02,310 --> 00:16:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're slow!</font>

218
00:16:03,900 --> 00:16:07,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

219
00:16:12,740 --> 00:16:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oops!</font>

220
00:16:23,210 --> 00:16:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fast movements and a keen nose...</font>

221
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Ninja Art of Beast Mimicry
turned out to be harmful...</font>

222
00:16:29,130 --> 00:16:31,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now Kiba's sense of smell
is tens of thousands times</font>

223
00:16:31,130 --> 00:16:32,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">more powerful than normal...</font>

224
00:16:37,350 --> 00:16:38,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

225
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:39,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That fart was probably
a freak accident, but...</font>

226
00:16:39,890 --> 00:16:43,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what you'd expect from
the number one unpredictable Ninja.</font>

227
00:16:43,850 --> 00:16:45,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

228
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now's your chance!</font>

229
00:16:48,730 --> 00:16:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!
I was straining too much...</font>

230
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now's the time to show
my new technique!</font>

231
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

232
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:02,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

233
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! The way you've torn me
apart up until now,</font>

234
00:17:05,170 --> 00:17:06,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give it back all at once!</font>

235
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:15,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn it!</font>

236
00:17:22,470 --> 00:17:23,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-!</font>

237
00:17:27,060 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zu-! Ma-! Ki-!</font>

238
00:17:39,990 --> 00:17:41,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... Barrage!</font>

239
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A new technique, eh?</font>

240
00:18:05,890 --> 00:18:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, he was watching Sasuke's
technique a moment ago...</font>

241
00:18:17,030 --> 00:18:18,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lions Barrage!</font>

242
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:21,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the record, the name
