243
00:18:41,930 --> 00:18:44,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner is Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

244
00:18:44,770 --> 00:18:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

245
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

246
00:18:48,770 --> 00:18:50,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice one!</font>

247
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it!</font>

248
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto beat Kiba!</font>

249
00:18:55,860 --> 00:18:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a major upset...</font>

250
00:18:57,690 --> 00:18:58,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup!</font>

251
00:19:00,610 --> 00:19:01,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

252
00:19:13,790 --> 00:19:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... getting stronger!</font>

253
00:19:24,510 --> 00:19:26,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was easy!</font>

254
00:19:28,810 --> 00:19:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What to do?</font>

255
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:32,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do...?</font>

256
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto-kun...</font>

257
00:19:40,820 --> 00:19:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Hinata?</font>

258
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you say something?</font>

259
00:19:49,330 --> 00:19:51,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, ah, ah...
Umm...</font>

260
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

261
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...?</font>

262
00:20:05,850 --> 00:20:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

263
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:09,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an ointment.</font>

264
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:12,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why for me?</font>

265
00:20:20,190 --> 00:20:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take it for her, Naruto.</font>

266
00:20:23,740 --> 00:20:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmmm. Okay!</font>

267
00:20:26,410 --> 00:20:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you! You're nice, Hinata!</font>

268
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba, it's nothing to be
embarrassed about ...</font>

269
00:20:37,380 --> 00:20:39,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kid was a really
strong opponent.</font>

270
00:20:55,850 --> 00:21:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are taking this pretty easy,
aren't you, Hinata-sama...?</font>

